        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SDH103, Solid Brass Long Shutter Door Holder</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-1/4\" long window shutter holder is easy to install and made from quality solid brass for longevity. The Solid Brass Long Shutter Door Holder includes all necessary mounting hardware. Deltana is an architectural door and window hardware manufacturer with a proven record for exceptional service and quality. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SDH103-Specifications.gif?v=1704354710\" width=\"439\" height=\"88\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SDH103 Solid Brass Long Shutter Door Holder Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-short-shutter-door-holder-deltana-sdh101\"><b>Short Shutter Door Holder</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana SDH103 Long Shutter Door Holder:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Includes matching finish hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
